WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.094 --> 00:00:08.572
Jason saw Chef standing near the recipe screen.

2
00:00:08.573 --> 00:00:12.868
"We're having a baking contest today," Chef said.

3
00:00:12.869 --> 00:00:17.349
Jason's eyes lit up. "That sounds fun!"

4
00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:21.558
"What are we baking?" Izzie asked.

5
00:00:21.559 --> 00:00:23.959
Chef pointed to the screen.

6
00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:29.023
"A simple brownie recipe with only four ingredients."

7
00:00:29.024 --> 00:00:32.825
"I love chocolate!" Nina said.

8
00:00:32.826 --> 00:00:38.581
Bobby grinned. "I'm going to win this contest!"

9
00:00:38.582 --> 00:00:40.681
Jason frowned.

10
00:00:40.682 --> 00:00:44.437
Bobby always wanted to win everything.

11
00:00:44.438 --> 00:00:48.474
"Izzie and Bobby—you'll be Team 1," Chef said.

12
00:00:48.475 --> 00:00:51.549
"Jason and Nina will be Team 2.

13
00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:53.864
I'll be the judge."

14
00:00:53.865 --> 00:00:57.575
"Our brownies will taste better!" Izzie said.

15
00:00:57.576 --> 00:01:00.806
Bobby gave her a high-five.

16
00:01:00.807 --> 00:01:03.036
Jason kept quiet.

17
00:01:03.037 --> 00:01:08.011
He loved cooking, and he wanted to do well.

18
00:01:08.012 --> 00:01:11.327
Chef had two cooking stations ready.

19
00:01:11.328 --> 00:01:14.587
The kids took their places.

20
00:01:14.588 --> 00:01:19.751
Chef preheated the oven to 180 degrees Celsius.

21
00:01:19.752 --> 00:01:25.070
Jason looked at the bananas, peanut butter, cocoa powder, and chocolate chips.

22
00:01:25.071 --> 00:01:29.701
"Amazing! We only need four ingredients to make brownies."

23
00:01:29.702 --> 00:01:36.337
Nina nodded. "First, we mash three bananas in a bowl."

24
00:01:36.338 --> 00:01:40.930
She and Jason took turns mashing them with a fork.

25
00:01:40.931 --> 00:01:44.039
Team 1 did the same thing.

26
00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:49.616
"We're Number 1! We're Number 1!" Bobby chanted.

27
00:01:49.617 --> 00:01:55.750
"Don't worry, Team 2!" Izzie laughed.

28
00:01:55.751 --> 00:02:00.042
"We'll share our winning brownies with you."

29
00:02:00.043 --> 00:02:03.031
"Team 1!" Chef frowned.

30
00:02:03.032 --> 00:02:07.534
"Mix your brownies and leave Team 2 alone."

31
00:02:07.535 --> 00:02:13.405
"Sorry, Chef," Bobby said.

32
00:02:13.406 --> 00:02:17.232
Izzie scooped peanut butter into a measuring cup.

33
00:02:17.233 --> 00:02:20.304
Then she tried to dump it into the bowl.

34
00:02:20.305 --> 00:02:23.907
But the peanut butter stuck to the cup.

35
00:02:23.908 --> 00:02:27.585
"Ugh!" she said.

36
00:02:27.586 --> 00:02:31.866
"Izzie didn't use cooking spray," Jason whispered.

37
00:02:31.867 --> 00:02:35.004
"Remember when we made peanut butter dog treats?

38
00:02:35.005 --> 00:02:37.952
We learned that tip!"

39
00:02:37.953 --> 00:02:42.524
"Right!" Nina said.

40
00:02:42.525 --> 00:02:47.041
She got the cooking spray and sprayed the measuring cup.

41
00:02:47.042 --> 00:02:51.163
Jason measured one-half cup of peanut butter.

42
00:02:51.164 --> 00:02:55.445
When he dumped it into the bowl, it slid right out.

43
00:02:55.446 --> 00:02:59.251
"Good job!" Nina said.

44
00:02:59.252 --> 00:03:03.374
Jason bowed. "Thank you."

45
00:03:03.375 --> 00:03:08.303
Nina added cocoa powder next.

46
00:03:08.304 --> 00:03:12.862
At Station 1, Bobby dumped in the cocoa powder too fast.

47
00:03:12.863 --> 00:03:15.250
A cloud rose up from the bowl.

48
00:03:15.251 --> 00:03:18.291
Izzie had some on her chin.

49
00:03:18.292 --> 00:03:22.659
"Watch it, Bobby!" she said.

50
00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:28.543
"Now we mix everything together," Jason said.

51
00:03:28.544 --> 00:03:33.974
He saw Chef watching them closely.

52
00:03:33.975 --> 00:03:39.434
Nina started the mixer and blended the ingredients into a thick batter.

53
00:03:39.435 --> 00:03:44.607
Jason folded a half cup of chocolate chips into the batter.

54
00:03:44.608 --> 00:03:49.945
Bobby started shouting. "I can do it!"

55
00:03:49.946 --> 00:03:53.328
"You're making a mess!"

56
00:03:53.329 --> 00:03:57.429
Izzie pulled the mixer away from Bobby.

57
00:03:57.430 --> 00:04:01.114
Jason was glad Nina was his partner.

58
00:04:01.115 --> 00:04:04.044
Nina greased the baking pan.

59
00:04:04.045 --> 00:04:07.312
Jason poured the batter.

60
00:04:07.313 --> 00:04:10.814
Chef put the two pans in the oven.

61
00:04:10.815 --> 00:04:17.130
"Team 1's brownies are on the left. Team 2's on the right."

62
00:04:17.131 --> 00:04:20.695
The kids were quiet as they cleaned up.

63
00:04:20.696 --> 00:04:28.125
When the timer beeped, Chef took the pans out.

64
00:04:28.126 --> 00:04:30.875
Jason's shoulders slumped.

65
00:04:30.876 --> 00:04:33.889
"They look exactly the same.

66
00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:37.176
How will you pick a winner?"

67
00:04:37.177 --> 00:04:41.893
Chef smiled. "They probably taste the same too.

68
00:04:41.894 --> 00:04:46.588
But that's okay because I declare Team 2 the winner.

69
00:04:46.589 --> 00:04:51.355
Nina and Jason, you worked very well together."

70
00:04:51.356 --> 00:04:58.315
Jason and Nina grinned at each other. "Yes!"

71
00:04:58.316 --> 00:05:03.405
When the brownies were cool, Chef cut them into squares.

72
00:05:03.406 --> 00:05:06.016
Everybody took one.

73
00:05:06.017 --> 00:05:10.243
"Congratulations, Team 2!"

74
00:05:10.244 --> 00:05:13.222
Bobby high-fived Jason.

75
00:05:13.223 --> 00:05:17.378
"Great teamwork," Izzie said.

76
00:05:17.379 --> 00:05:25.071
"Great brownies too!" Jason said.

